chapter.v:
But as 


for me,, 


I will look to the LORD; I will wait for the God of my salvation; my God will hear me.

A day 


for the, 


building of your walls! In that day the boundary shall be far extended.

The nations 


shall see, 


and be ashamed of all their might; they shall lay their hands on their mouths; their ears shall be deaf;
